OL,3,GNEWSASchool upgrades unveiled as pupils
OL,4,Areturn
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils returning to school this week
OL,7,Fwill find new facilities, improved
OL,8,Faccess and enhanced security after a
OL,9,Fsummer programme of investment, a
OL,10,Fcouncil has said.
OL,12,FAcross West Berkshire, work was carried
OL,13,Fout at a number of schools and
OL,14,Fnurseries while classrooms were empty
OL,15,Ffor the holidays.
OL,17,FMore than #9m has been invested in
OL,18,Fprojects ranging from a new early years
OL,19,Ffacility and replacement classrooms, to
OL,20,FSEND provision and accessibility
OL,21,Fimprovements.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
